{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"138c6277-04fe-4cfb-9b9b-65375aaa1e79","ts":"2026-10-18T14:42:13.993-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"204","nodeName":"Google Gemini Chat Model","workflowName":"04_Validation_Fraud_Decision_Agent","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini","workflowId":"hyKQcsHn7Jr2K7qH","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"Human: You are the Fraud Risk & Decision Agent of ClaimShield AI, reviewing a motor insurance damage claim.\\n\\nThe rule engine has already scored objective warning signs. Your job is to add nuance: look for inconsistencies between the claim, the photo analysis, the invoice and the policy result that the rules did NOT already count.\\n\\nCLAIM:\\n{\\n  \\\"claim_id\\\": \\\"CLM-20261018-183850\\\",\\n  \\\"client_name\\\": \\\"Bahaeddine Amara\\\",\\n  \\\"client_email\\\": \\\"bahamaraaaaa@gmail.com\\\",\\n  \\\"client_phone\\\": \\\"+21620922401\\\",\\n  \\\"incident_date\\\": \\\"2026-10-16\\\",\\n  \\\"incident_time\\\": \\\"09:28\\\",\\n  \\\"incident_datetime\\\": \\\"2026-10-16T09:28:00\\\",\\n  \\\"location\\\": {\\n    \\\"street\\\": \\\"Kaab Ibn Malek street\\\",\\n    \\\"city\\\": \\\"Ariana\\\",\\n    \\\"postal_code\\\": \\\"2091\\\",\\n    \\\"country\\\": \\\"Tunisia\\\",\\n    \\\"lat\\\": 36.843911,\\n    \\\"lon\\\": 10.166199\\n  },\\n  \\\"incident_location\\\": \\\"Kaab Ibn Malek street, 2091 Ariana, Tunisia\\\",\\n  \\\"description\\\": \\\"I was stopped at a red light when a car behind me hit my rear bumper.\\\",\\n  \\\"claim_type\\\": \\\"not specified (see description)\\\",\\n  \\\"photo_count\\\": 2,\\n  \\\"has_invoice\\\": true,\\n  \\\"submitted_at\\\": \\\"2026-10-18T18:38:50.101Z\\\",\\n  \\\"photo_taken_dates\\\": [\\n    \\\"2026-10-14\\\",\\n    \\\"2026-10-14\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"photo_hashes\\\": [\\n    \\\"e5085014640c7fca31b03afdfedf21362caff433a7c873aad8d1334eb1bdbd54\\\",\\n    \\\"4f3dee7394c2b579d4072a4d4137fbcbc319f31ae7f6902c468b5b1dc74d2c12\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"claimed_amount\\\": 1201.9\\n}\\n\\nVALIDATION CHECK (required fields, photo fingerprints and dates):\\n{\\n  \\\"stage\\\": \\\"validate\\\",\\n  \\\"claim_id\\\": \\\"CLM-20261018-183850\\\",\\n  \\\"valid\\\": true,\\n  \\\"reasons\\\": [],\\n  \\\"checked_at\\\": \\\"2026-10-18T18:38:50.228Z\\\",\\n  \\\"photo_checks\\\": {\\n    \\\"photos_checked\\\": 2,\\n    \\\"photo_reused\\\": false,\\n    \\\"reused_from_claims\\\": [],\\n    \\\"photo_taken_dates\\\": [\\n      \\\"2026-10-14\\\",\\n      \\\"2026-10-14\\\"\\n    ],\\n    \\\"photos_without_date\\\": []\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nVISUAL INSPECTION RESULT (accident_description = the accident as seen on the photos):\\n{\\n  \\\"claim_id\\\": \\\"CLM-20261018-183850\\\",\\n  \\\"asset_type\\\": \\\"vehicle\\\",\\n  \\\"damage_severity\\\": 2,\\n  \\\"damaged_items\\\": [\\n    \\\"rear_bumper\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"damage_location\\\": \\\"rear_left\\\",\\n  \\\"damage_cause_observed\\\": \\\"collision\\\",\\n  \\\"matches_description\\\": true,\\n  \\\"mismatch_reason\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"pre_existing_damage_signs\\\": false,\\n  \\\"pre_existing_reason\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"same_asset_across_photos\\\": true,\\n  \\\"asset_inconsistency_reason\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"suspicious_image_flags\\\": [],\\n  \\\"confidence\\\": 0.95,\\n  \\\"summary\\\": \\\"The rear bumper of a white Volkswagen Polo shows a deep dent, cracking, and surface scuffs on the left side.\\\",\\n  \\\"accident_description\\\": \\\"The photographs show a white Volkswagen Polo that has sustained localized damage to the rear-left bumper cover. The bumper is indented, cracked through the plastic, and marked with paint abrasions. This deformation is consistent with a rear-end collision from a vehicle striking the rear bumper while the car was stationary.\\\",\\n  \\\"duplicate_photo_detected\\\": false,\\n  \\\"duplicate_photos\\\": [],\\n  \\\"damaged_parts\\\": [\\n    \\\"rear_bumper\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"photo_reused\\\": false,\\n  \\\"reused_from_claims\\\": [],\\n  \\\"same_vehicle_across_photos\\\": true\\n}\\n\\nINVOICE RESULT (summary = what the invoice says):\\n{\\n  \\\"agent\\\": \\\"invoice_parser\\\",\\n  \\\"error\\\": false,\\n  \\\"summary\\\": \\\"Invoice F-2026-2041 from GARAGE EL AMEN - Tunis dated 2026-10-16, vehicle 214 TU 8812. 1 part(s): Pare-choc arriere. Labor: 210.00 TND. Total: 1201.90 TND. The amounts add up.\\\",\\n  \\\"key_info\\\": {\\n    \\\"invoice_number\\\": \\\"F-2026-2041\\\",\\n    \\\"garage_name\\\": \\\"GARAGE EL AMEN - Tunis\\\",\\n    \\\"invoice_date\\\": \\\"2026-10-16\\\",\\n    \\\"vehicle_plate\\\": \\\"214 TU 8812\\\",\\n    \\\"currency\\\": \\\"TND\\\",\\n    \\\"parts\\\": [\\n      \\\"Pare-choc arriere\\\"\\n    ],\\n    \\\"labor_total\\\": 210,\\n    \\\"total_before_tax\\\": 1010,\\n    \\\"tax\\\": 191.9,\\n    \\\"total\\\": 1201.9\\n  },\\n  \\\"totals_match\\\": true,\\n  \\\"arithmetic_issue\\\": null,\\n  \\\"line_items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"part\\\": \\\"Pare-choc arriere\\\",\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"part\\\",\\n      \\\"quantity\\\": 1,\\n      \\\"unit_price\\\": 620,\\n      \\\"line_total\\\": 620,\\n      \\\"part_code\\\": \\\"rear_bumper\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"part\\\": \\\"Peinture pare-choc arriere\\\",\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"other\\\",\\n      \\\"quantity\\\": 1,\\n      \\\"unit_price\\\": 180,\\n      \\\"line_total\\\": 180,\\n      \\\"part_code\\\": null\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"part\\\": \\\"Main d'oeuvre\\\",\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"labor\\\",\\n      \\\"quantity\\\": 3,\\n      \\\"unit_price\\\": 70,\\n      \\\"line_total\\\": 210,\\n      \\\"part_code\\\": null\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"status\\\": \\\"ok\\\",\\n  \\\"risk_points\\\": 0,\\n  \\\"source_file\\\": \\\"/data/invoices/CLM-20261018-183850.pdf\\\",\\n  \\\"extraction_method\\\": \\\"native_pdf_text\\\",\\n  \\\"invoice\\\": {\\n    \\\"is_invoice\\\": true,\\n    \\\"invoice_number\\\": \\\"F-2026-2041\\\",\\n    \\\"garage_name\\\": \\\"GARAGE EL AMEN - Tunis\\\",\\n    \\\"invoice_date\\\": \\\"2026-10-16\\\",\\n    \\\"vehicle_plate\\\": \\\"214 TU 8812\\\",\\n    \\\"prices_include_tax\\\": false,\\n    \\\"line_items\\\": [\\n      {\\n        \\\"description\\\": \\\"Pare-choc arriere\\\",\\n        \\\"category\\\": \\\"part\\\",\\n        \\\"quantity\\\": 1,\\n        \\\"unit_price\\\": 620,\\n        \\\"line_total\\\": 620\\n      },\\n      {\\n        \\\"description\\\": \\\"Peinture pare-choc arriere\\\",\\n        \\\"category\\\": \\\"paint\\\",\\n        \\\"quantity\\\": 1,\\n        \\\"unit_price\\\": 180,\\n        \\\"line_total\\\": 180\\n      },\\n      {\\n        \\\"description\\\": \\\"Main d'oeuvre\\\",\\n        \\\"category\\\": \\\"labor\\\",\\n        \\\"quantity\\\": 3,\\n        \\\"unit_price\\\": 70,\\n        \\\"line_total\\\": 210\\n      }\\n    ],\\n    \\\"subtotal\\\": 1010,\\n    \\\"net_before_tax\\\": 1010,\\n    \\\"vat_rate\\\": 19,\\n    \\\"vat\\\": 191.9,\\n    \\\"total\\\": 1201.9\\n  },\\n  \\\"claimed_parts\\\": [\\n    \\\"Pare-choc arriere\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"arithmetic_check\\\": {\\n    \\\"ok\\\": true,\\n    \\\"issues\\\": [],\\n    \\\"unchecked_lines\\\": [],\\n    \\\"computed_lines_sum\\\": 1010,\\n    \\\"computed_total\\\": 1201.9\\n  },\\n  \\\"review_reasons\\\": [],\\n  \\\"ungrounded_amounts\\\": [],\\n  \\\"extraction\\\": {\\n    \\\"chunks\\\": 1,\\n    \\\"llm_fallback_used\\\": false\\n  },\\n  \\\"part_codes\\\": [\\n    \\\"rear_bumper\\\"\\n  ]\\n}\\n\\nPOLICY COVERAGE RESULT:\\n{\\n  \\\"coverage_status\\\": \\\"COVERED\\\",\\n  \\\"cited_clauses\\\": [\\n    \\\"Section I\\\",\\n    \\\"IMT 22\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"COVERED \\\\nYour policy covers damage to your car caused by another vehicle hitting it from behind. This falls under Section I of the Liberty Private Car Package Policy.  You will need to pay a deductible as stated in IMT 22, which is the higher amount between what's stated there and what's stated in the policy itself. There are no exclusions that apply based on the information provided.\\\"\\n}\\n\\nINCIDENT PLAUSIBILITY RESULT (the story checked against the map, the weather and the invoiced parts):\\n{\\n  \\\"summary\\\": \\\"No warning signs: the story is consistent with the map, the weather and the invoice. Some checks were skipped (the map service did not answer).\\\",\\n  \\\"warning_signs\\\": []\\n}\\n\\nWARNING SIGNS ALREADY SCORED BY RULES (rule score 15/60):\\n[\\n  {\\n    \\\"code\\\": \\\"PHOTO_BEFORE_INCIDENT\\\",\\n    \\\"points\\\": 15,\\n    \\\"detail\\\": \\\"2 photo(s) dated before the incident date\\\"\\n  }\\n]\\n\\nRULES FOR YOUR ANSWER:\\n1. llm_adjustment is an integer from 0 to 40. Use 0 when you find nothing beyond the rules.\\n2. Never re-count a warning sign that is already listed above.\\n3. Every point you add must be explained in justification, citing the specific fields that support it.\\n4. Base your answer only on the data above. Do not guess.\\n5. Example concerns: claimed amount far above what the damage severity suggests, impact zone that does not fit the description, an accident time or description that does not fit what the photos show, invoiced work that does not fit the described accident.\\n\\nReturn ONLY a raw JSON object, with no markdown and no text around it:\\n{\\n  \\\"llm_adjustment\\\": <integer 0-40>,\\n  \\\"justification\\\": \\\"<one or two sentences>\\\",\\n  \\\"additional_concerns\\\": [\\\"<short concern>\\\"]\\n}\"],\"options\":{\"google_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"GOOGLE_API_KEY\"]},\"base_url\":\"https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com\",\"model\":\"gemini-3.7-flash\",\"temperature\":0.2},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"{\\n  \\\"llm_adjustment\\\": 0,\\n  \\\"justification\\\": \\\"The damage location, severity, and invoiced repair operations align consistently with the described accident, and no discrepancies were identified beyond the already scored photo timestamp issue.\\\",\\n  \\\"additional_concerns\\\": []\\n}\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finishReason\":\"STOP\",\"index\":0}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":61,\"promptTokens\":2713,\"totalTokens\":2774}}}"}}
