{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"5b49ee77-2621-48c1-80fd-293062fde7e7","ts":"2026-10-18T14:52:04.185-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"212","nodeName":"gemma2 (judge)","workflowName":"RAG Agent & LLM-as-a-Judge Pipeline","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOllama","workflowId":"FwCOIOAfJsT7eTvB","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"Human: You are a strict QA Compliance Evaluator for an Insurance RAG System.\\n\\nUSER QUERY:\\nMotor insurance claim under the Liberty Private Car Package Policy.\\nDate of the accident: 2026-10-13 at 08:47.\\nWhat happened, in the policyholder's words: Someone cut me off and the front of my car got damaged.\\nIs this damage covered by the policy? Search the policy first.\\nStart your answer with exactly one of these words: COVERED, EXCLUDED or REQUIRES_REVIEW.\\nThen, in three to five sentences addressed to the policyholder, explain what the policy says about this case:\\nwhat is covered, the conditions that apply and any exclusion that could apply.\\nCite the section, IMT or AD codes you relied on.\\n\\nAGENT RESPONSE TO EVALUATE:\\nCOVERED  Your policy covers damage to your car caused by another vehicle, as long as it's a private use accident with an authorized driver. Section I of the policy applies to own damage claims and states that the insurer will pay for repairs up to the Insured Declared Value (IDV) of your vehicle. However, there is a compulsory deductible that applies, which you can find in IMT 22.\\n\\nEVALUATION RULES:\\n1. PASS CONDITION (\\\"pass\\\": true): The response MUST contain explicit insurance policy facts, numerical values, clause references, or specific terms (e.g., waiting periods, depreciation %, IMT codes, cover limits) retrieved from the database.\\n2. FAIL CONDITION (\\\"pass\\\": false): If the response contains any fallback disclaimer (e.g., \\\"Information not found\\\", \\\"consult customer support\\\"), refusals, small talk, or general non-policy answers, it is INVALID (\\\"pass\\\": false).\\n\\nOutput ONLY one JSON object with the keys score, pass and reasoning:\\n- If valid policy facts are present:\\n  {\\\"score\\\": 5, \\\"pass\\\": true, \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"Response contains verified policy clauses.\\\"}\\n- If fallback text, refusal, or missing policy context:\\n  {\\\"score\\\": 1, \\\"pass\\\": false, \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"Response contains fallback disclaimer or lacks retrieved policy context.\\\"}\"],\"options\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"not_implemented\",\"id\":[\"langchain\",\"chat_models\",\"ollama\",\"ChatOllama\"]},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"{\\\"score\\\": 4, \\\"pass\\\": true, \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"Response mentions relevant policy sections and IMT codes but lacks specific details like cover limits or deductible amount.\\\"}\"}]]},\"tokenUsageEstimate\":{\"completionTokens\":37,\"promptTokens\":440,\"totalTokens\":477}}}"}}
