nsult customer support\\\"), refusals, small talk, or general non-policy answers, it is INVALID (\\\"pass\\\": false).\\n\\nOutput ONLY one JSON object with the keys score, pass and reasoning:\\n- If valid policy facts are present:\\n  {\\\"score\\\": 5, \\\"pass\\\": true, \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"Response contains verified policy clauses.\\\"}\\n- If fallback text, refusal, or missing policy context:\\n  {\\\"score\\\": 1, \\\"pass\\\": false, \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"Response contains fallback disclaimer or lacks retrieved policy context.\\\"}\"],\"options\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"not_implemented\",\"id\":[\"langchain\",\"chat_models\",\"ollama\",\"ChatOllama\"]},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"{\\\"score\\\": 3, \\\"pass\\\": false, \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"While the response mentions policy sections and IMT codes, it lacks specific details like cover limits, depreciation percentages, or the exact wording of relevant clauses. It also makes a general statement about exclusions without citing any specific exclusions from the policy.\\\"}\"}]]},\"tokenUsageEstimate\":{\"completionTokens\":64,\"promptTokens\":442,\"totalTokens\":506}}}"}}
