ic exclusions from the policy.\\n\\nTASK:\\nAnalyze the evaluator feedback and generate a refined, highly specific technical query (3 to 6 keywords) for the vector database.\\n- Use explicit policy terminology, clause references, or codes (e.g., \\\"IMT 22 compulsory deductible\\\", \\\"AD-17 charger protection\\\", \\\"Poorna Suraksha waiting period\\\").\\n- Do NOT output explanations or conversational text.\\n- Output ONLY the refined raw search query string.\"],\"options\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"not_implemented\",\"id\":[\"langchain\",\"chat_models\",\"ollama\",\"ChatOllama\"]},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"Liberty Private Car Package Policy IMT 22  collision damage cover  rear bumper repair  depreciation  exclusions  \\n\"}]]},\"tokenUsageEstimate\":{\"completionTokens\":23,\"promptTokens\":409,\"totalTokens\":432}}}"}}
