\\\"), refusals, small talk, or general non-policy answers, it is INVALID (\\\"pass\\\": false).\\n\\nOutput ONLY one JSON object with the keys score, pass and reasoning:\\n- If valid policy facts are present:\\n  {\\\"score\\\": 5, \\\"pass\\\": true, \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"Response contains verified policy clauses.\\\"}\\n- If fallback text, refusal, or missing policy context:\\n  {\\\"score\\\": 1, \\\"pass\\\": false, \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"Response contains fallback disclaimer or lacks retrieved policy context.\\\"}\"],\"options\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"not_implemented\",\"id\":[\"langchain\",\"chat_models\",\"ollama\",\"ChatOllama\"]},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"{\\\"score\\\": 4, \\\"pass\\\": true, \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"Response mentions relevant sections (Section I) and IMT codes (IMT 25), but lacks specific details like deductible amounts, depreciation percentages, or cover limits.\\\"}\"}]]},\"tokenUsageEstimate\":{\"completionTokens\":50,\"promptTokens\":443,\"totalTokens\":493}}}"}}
