not found\\\", \\\"consult customer support\\\"), refusals, small talk, or general non-policy answers, it is INVALID (\\\"pass\\\": false).\\n\\nOutput ONLY one JSON object with the keys score, pass and reasoning:\\n- If valid policy facts are present:\\n  {\\\"score\\\": 5, \\\"pass\\\": true, \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"Response contains verified policy clauses.\\\"}\\n- If fallback text, refusal, or missing policy context:\\n  {\\\"score\\\": 1, \\\"pass\\\": false, \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"Response contains fallback disclaimer or lacks retrieved policy context.\\\"}\"],\"options\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"not_implemented\",\"id\":[\"langchain\",\"chat_models\",\"ollama\",\"ChatOllama\"]},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"{\\\"score\\\": 3, \\\"pass\\\": false, \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"While the response mentions relevant sections and IMT codes, it lacks specific details like deductible amount, repair limitations, or cover limits. It also uses general terms like 'high damage' without referencing any policy-defined thresholds.\\\"}\"}]]},\"tokenUsageEstimate\":{\"completionTokens\":60,\"promptTokens\":450,\"totalTokens\":510}}}"}}
