{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"28243d6a-66d1-4976-a1be-f70f4a58e766","ts":"2026-10-18T15:22:33.201-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"227","nodeName":"gemma2 (answer)","workflowName":"RAG Agent & LLM-as-a-Judge Pipeline","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOllama","workflowId":"FwCOIOAfJsT7eTvB","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"Human: You are the Policy Coverage Agent of ClaimShield AI. You answer from two policies only: the Liberty Private Car Package Policy (motor) and HDFC Life Poorna Suraksha (life, critical illness). Your only source is the POLICY CLAUSES below.\\n\\nONE SHOT: write one complete, final answer. The reader cannot reply.\\n\\nRULES\\n1. Never ask a question. Never write \\\"please clarify\\\", \\\"could you\\\", \\\"can you confirm\\\", \\\"let me know\\\" or \\\"I need more details\\\". If a detail is missing, assume it, say so in a few words (\\\"Assuming ...\\\"), and answer.\\n2. Default assumptions for car claims: own damage claim under Section I of the Package policy, authorised and licensed driver, private use, no alcohol. What the car hit does not matter.\\n3. Use only the clauses below: every fact, number and code must appear in them. Copy numbers exactly. Cite the section, IMT, AD, Part or Clause as written (e.g. \\\"Section I\\\", \\\"IMT 22\\\").\\n4. Car damage, repairs, towing and theft belong to the Liberty policy; death and critical illness to the HDFC Life policy.\\n\\nFORMAT\\nA. If the question asks you to start with COVERED, EXCLUDED or REQUIRES_REVIEW:\\n   Line 1: one word: COVERED (covered, no exclusion clearly applies), EXCLUDED (a clause below clearly excludes it) or REQUIRES_REVIEW (the clauses are not enough to decide).\\n   Then 3 to 5 sentences to the policyholder (\\\"Your policy ...\\\"): what is covered, the conditions (deductible, depreciation, limits) and any exclusion to watch, with citations.\\nB. Any other question: sentence 1 answers it, then up to 4 sentences of conditions and numbers with citations.\\nPlain text only: no greeting, no headings, no bullet points, no question.\\n\\nNOTHING RELEVANT IN THE CLAUSES\\nA. \\\"REQUIRES_REVIEW\\\" then \\\"The retrieved policy clauses do not state whether this damage is covered, so an adjuster must check the master policy.\\\"\\nB. Exactly \\\"Information not found in the retrieved policy clauses. Please consult the master policy document or contact customer support.\\\"\\n\\nPOLICY CLAUSES\\n[Clause 1] mentioned coverages as opted either of section 1 and 2 as mentioned below or jointly together as a whole and specified in the policy schedule: AD17 :- Charger Protection cover Any loss of/or damage, or destruction to detachable charger, including charging cables and charging adaptors or due to: ●Theft or burglary ●Impact damage caused by external accidental means. ●Fire, explosion, self-ignition provided all instructions as prescribed by the manufacturer are followed, and\\n\\n[Clause 2] www.libertyinsurance.in Toll Free No : 1800 266 5844 Liberty General Insurance Limited 10th Floor, Tower A, Peninsula Business Park, Ganpatrao Kadam Marg, Lower Parel, Mumbai - 400 013 Phone: +91 22 6700 1313 Fax: +91 22 6700 1606 Email: care@libertyinsurance.in IRDA of India registration number: 150 l CIN: U66000MH2010PLC209656 POLICY WORDINGS PRIVATE CAR PACKAGE POLICY IMT.25. CNG/LPG KIT IN BI-FUEL SYSTEM (Own Damage cover for the kit )\\n\\n[Clause 3] Liberty General Insurance Limited 10th Floor, Tower A, Peninsula Business Park, Ganpatrao Kadam Marg, Lower Parel, Mumbai - 400 013 Phone: +91 22 6700 1313 Fax: +91 22 6700 1606 Email: care@libertyinsurance.in IRDA of India registration number: 150 l CIN: U66000MH2010PLC209656 POLICY WORDINGS PRIVATE CAR PACKAGE POLICY www.libertyinsurance.in Toll Free No : 1800 266 5844 IMT.39. Legal Liability to persons employed in connection with the operation\\n\\n[Clause 4] Liberty General Insurance Limited 10th Floor, Tower A, Peninsula Business Park, Ganpatrao Kadam Marg, Lower Parel, Mumbai - 400 013 Phone: +91 22 6700 1313 Fax: +91 22 6700 1606 Email: care@libertyinsurance.in IRDA of India registration number: 150 l CIN: U66000MH2010PLC209656 www.libertyinsurance.in Toll Free No : 1800 266 5844 POLICY WORDINGS PRIVATE CAR PACKAGE POLICY limitations, that the Company will indemnify the insured as per the below\\n\\nQUESTION\\nMotor insurance claim under the Liberty Private Car Package Policy.\\nDate of the accident: 2026-10-15 at 09:17.\\nWhat happened, in the policyholder's words: Rear end got hit by a fast speeding car, high damage.\\nIs this damage covered by the policy? Search the policy first.\\nStart your answer with exactly one of these words: COVERED, EXCLUDED or REQUIRES_REVIEW.\\nThen, in three to five sentences addressed to the policyholder, explain what the policy says about this case:\\nwhat is covered, the conditions that apply and any exclusion that could apply.\\nCite the section, IMT or AD codes you relied on.\\n\\nANSWER\"],\"options\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"not_implemented\",\"id\":[\"langchain\",\"chat_models\",\"ollama\",\"ChatOllama\"]},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"COVERED \\nYour policy covers damage to your car caused by an external accidental means, as stated in Section I of the Package Policy. Assuming this accident meets the definition of \\\"external accidental means\\\" and was not due to any excluded causes listed in the policy, your claim would be considered.  The policy also mentions a deductible amount that applies to own damage claims, which you can find in IMT 25. Please refer to your policy schedule for specific details regarding coverage limits and deductibles.\\n\\n\\n\"}]]},\"tokenUsageEstimate\":{\"completionTokens\":100,\"promptTokens\":1108,\"totalTokens\":1208}}}"}}
