ntains any fallback disclaimer (e.g., \\\"Information not found\\\", \\\"consult customer support\\\"), refusals, small talk, or general non-policy answers, it is INVALID (\\\"pass\\\": false).\\n\\nOutput ONLY one JSON object with the keys score, pass and reasoning:\\n- If valid policy facts are present:\\n  {\\\"score\\\": 5, \\\"pass\\\": true, \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"Response contains verified policy clauses.\\\"}\\n- If fallback text, refusal, or missing policy context:\\n  {\\\"score\\\": 1, \\\"pass\\\": false, \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"Response contains fallback disclaimer or lacks retrieved policy context.\\\"}\"],\"options\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"not_implemented\",\"id\":[\"langchain\",\"chat_models\",\"ollama\",\"ChatOllama\"]},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"{\\\"score\\\": 3, \\\"pass\\\": false, \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"While the response mentions relevant sections (Section I, IMT 25) and concepts like 'deductible', it lacks specific policy facts like coverage limits, deductible amounts, or precise definitions of 'external accidental means' from the database.\\\"}\"}]]},\"tokenUsageEstimate\":{\"completionTokens\":65,\"promptTokens\":456,\"totalTokens\":521}}}"}}
