026-10-15 despite billing 10 hours of labor following a 09:17 morning accident.\\\",\\n  \\\"additional_concerns\\\": [\\n    \\\"Visual inspection detected suspicious image flags including 'screenshot' and 'edited image'\\\",\\n    \\\"Implausible turnaround time with an invoice issued on the incident date (2026-10-15) billing 10 labor hours\\\"\\n  ]\\n}\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finishReason\":\"STOP\",\"index\":0}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":150,\"promptTokens\":3213,\"totalTokens\":3363}}}"}}
